CanvasWorkspace
WorkspaceStorage
CanvasWorkspace drafts
+ documentId -> metadata + CanvasSession
+ metadata = name / savedName / revisionId / representationId
+ savedScene / savedEdges / viewport / busy / hidden / focusBox
+ controllers Map -> each session's MappingDocumentController
+ dirtyScenes -> IDs whose scene differs from the saved baseline
