controller.nodes() -> cached registry -> structured clone
Rendered workspace
+ mounted document -> DraggableDiagramCanvas -> MappingPocSelectionCanvas
+ session supplied per draft; inactive documents retained and hidden
+ onUpdateDiagram -> DiagramEditCoordinator -> DiagramEditComposer
+ onTransfer / onUndo -> MappingPage workspace coordination [E]
+ onJump -> open target canvas -> focus box / content node
+ DiagramSearchPanel <- saved + draft + proposal search documents
+ MappingDiagramExplorer <- catalog + drafts + dirty/busy state
+ ChangeSessionPreview <- changeMode; accepted revisions reopen canvases
Startup and restore
+ project representations + storage.load() -> independent reads
+ saved workspace -> project check -> prune -> reconcile -> draft sessions
+ otherwise -> requested settled canvas OR first settled canvas
+ activeId + mountedDocuments determine visible canvas
Agent access
+ useAgentCanvasBridge -> handleAgentCommand -> document controller [D]
+ visible draft descriptors; ephemeral canvasId + stableWorkspaceId
+ HTTP registration / command polling / replies; WebSocket selections
Live view and persistence
+ SourcePaneViewState -> live scroll + camera
+ captureDisplay / captureCamera -> workspace capture and record writes
+ session checkpoint change -> onCommit -> WorkspacePersistence [E]
+ workspace capture -> schemaVersion 3 + projectId + activeDocumentId
+ transfers[] + documents[history, document, canvas, viewport, baseline]
Project save
+ capture name + history + scene + edges + expectedRevisionId
+ -> saveMappingProjectDiagram -> acknowledged representation revision
+ -> update captured baseline -> recompute CanvasSession dirty status
+ isDirty = scene changed OR edges changed OR name changed
+ newer edits made during save remain compared with the captured baseline

